THAT A DEPLOYER WITHHOLDS INFORMATION PURSUANT TO THIS SUBSECTION (8) OR SECTION 6-1-1705 (5), THE DEPLOYER SHALL NOTIFY THE CONSUMER AND PROVIDE A BASIS FOR THE WITHHOLDING.

