“(m) Covered Local Park Defined.—In this section, the term ‘covered local park’ means a local park, as defined in subsection (h) of section 4 of the Technology in the Parks Act of 2024, that has a contract with an entity to allow such entity to conduct in such park a qualified technology training program using a grant received by such entity under such section.”.SEC. 3. LOAN, LEASE, OR TRANSFER OF CERTAIN EXCESS RESEARCH EQUIPMENT.
Subsection (i) of section 11 of the Stevenson-Wydler Technology Innovation Act of 1980 (15 U.S.C. 3710) is amended—
(1) by striking “The Director” and inserting the following:
“(1) IN GENERAL.—The Director”;
